{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.HelicityCommonSource","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuarkState.HelicityCommonSource","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.PhotonPairNormalForm","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3AlgebraInstance","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Abel","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Module","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp"],"declarations":66,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.pair_swap_id_netFlavour","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.pair_swap_id_netFlavour","kind":"theorem","line":518,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L518-L523","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.pair_swap_id_coord0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.pair_swap_id_coord0","kind":"theorem","line":512,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L512-L516","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.pair_id_swap_netFlavour","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.pair_id_swap_netFlavour","kind":"theorem","line":503,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L503-L510","doc":"σ-photon against swap-photon: net flavour `(ψ₀ + ψ₁) − (φ₀ + φ₁)ψ₀₁`\n(compare 6a's `pairBar_netFlavour`: `−(ψ₀ + ψ₁) − (φ₀ + φ₁)ψ₀₁`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.pair_id_swap_coord0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.pair_id_swap_coord0","kind":"theorem","line":497,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L497-L501","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.photonSwap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.photonSwap","kind":"def","line":492,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L492-L495","doc":"The photon with eigenline-swapped letters, `1 + φ₀(h−σ₀) + φ₁(h−σ₁) + φ₀₁(h−σ₀)(h−σ₁)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.netFlavour_flavours_differ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.netFlavour_flavours_differ","kind":"theorem","line":484,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L484-L490","doc":"**Net flavour is not a function of the eigenline labelling**: the two corpus\nflavours of one letter have the same projector pair (`corpus_flavours_same_lines`) and\ndifferent net flavour. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.netFlavour_swapLetter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.netFlavour_swapLetter","kind":"theorem","line":474,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L474-L482","doc":"`netFlavour` of `σ`, `σ⁻¹`, `−σ⁻¹` is `0`, `−1`, `+1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swapLetter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swapLetter","kind":"def","line":470,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L470-L472","doc":"The eigenline-swapped letter `−σ_g⁻¹ = h − σ_g`, with `h` formal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.positron_ne_electron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.positron_ne_electron","kind":"theorem","line":450,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L450-L458","doc":"**The mirror changes the particle**: `e⁺ ≠ e⁻` whenever `h ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.positron_v3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.positron_v3","kind":"theorem","line":445,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L445-L448","doc":"The positron's `σ₁σ₀` coordinate is `−h`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.neg_electron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.neg_electron","kind":"theorem","line":441,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L441-L443","doc":"`neg` sends the electron to MINUS ITSELF (same word, sign `(−1)^3`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.electron_ne_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.electron_ne_swap","kind":"theorem","line":431,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L431-L439","doc":"**The relabelling does not fix the electron** (char ≠ 2): the electron is a positive word\nin exactly one of the two letter systems at parameter `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.positron_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.positron_top","kind":"theorem","line":426,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L426-L429","doc":"… and of the positron also `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.electron_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.electron_top","kind":"theorem","line":422,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L422-L424","doc":"The top coordinate (`σ₀σ₁σ₀`) of the electron is `1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_electron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_electron","kind":"theorem","line":417,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L417-L420","doc":"**The relabelling sends the electron to MINUS the positron.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_braid","kind":"theorem","line":410,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L410-L415","doc":"The relabelled letters still satisfy the braid relation, so relabelling every letter\nis a consistent presentation of the same algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_braid","kind":"theorem","line":402,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L402-L408","doc":"The mirrored letters satisfy the braid relation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_sig1_v","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_sig1_v","kind":"theorem","line":398,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L398-L400","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_sig0_v","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_sig0_v","kind":"theorem","line":394,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L394-L396","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.positron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.positron","kind":"def","line":391,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L391-L392","doc":"The positron, the mirror word `σ₀⁻¹σ₁⁻¹σ₀⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.electron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.electron","kind":"def","line":388,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L388-L389","doc":"The electron `σ₀σ₁σ₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.corpus_flavours_same_lines","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.corpus_flavours_same_lines","kind":"theorem","line":376,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L376-L380","doc":"**The two corpus flavours of a letter carry the same eigenline pair.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.sig1_letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.sig1_letter","kind":"theorem","line":371,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L371-L374","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.sig0_letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.sig0_letter","kind":"theorem","line":366,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L366-L369","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.sig1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.sig1","kind":"def","line":363,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L363-L364","doc":"`σ₁` as an element of the NF ring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.sig0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.sig0","kind":"def","line":361,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L361-L362","doc":"`σ₀` as an element of the NF ring at `h = q − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.no_linear_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.no_linear_neg","kind":"theorem","line":336,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L336-L349","doc":"**No `K`-linear algebra map realises `neg`** either, unless `q² = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.no_linear_flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.no_linear_flip","kind":"theorem","line":316,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L316-L334","doc":"**No `K`-linear algebra map realises the flip.** If an algebra endomorphism sends a\nletter to its inverse, then `2(q − q⁻¹) = 0`: impossible for `q² ≠ 1` in char ≠ 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_swap","kind":"theorem","line":312,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L312-L314","doc":"Klein relation: `flip ∘ swap = neg`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_neg","kind":"theorem","line":308,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L308-L310","doc":"Klein relation: `flip ∘ neg = swap`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.neg_Pm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.neg_Pm","kind":"theorem","line":305,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L305-L306","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.neg_Pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.neg_Pp","kind":"theorem","line":301,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L301-L303","doc":"`neg` exchanges the eigenprojectors (read at the moved parameter). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_flip","kind":"theorem","line":298,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L298-L299","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.neg_hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.neg_hecke","kind":"theorem","line":293,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L293-L296","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_word2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_word2","kind":"theorem","line":284,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L284-L286","doc":"On a two-letter word the relabelling IS the mirror (even length, no sign). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_word3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_word3","kind":"theorem","line":278,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L278-L282","doc":"**On a three-letter word the L↔R relabelling is minus the mirror.** Applying the swap to\nevery letter of `a·b·a` gives `−(a⁻¹·b⁻¹·a⁻¹)`: the knot mirror times `(−1)^{length}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_swap","kind":"theorem","line":274,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L274-L276","doc":"The swap is an involution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_asym_bar_odd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_asym_bar_odd","kind":"theorem","line":266,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L266-L272","doc":"**The skein difference is bar-odd**: the orientation flip (`q ↦ q⁻¹`, `s ↦ s⁻¹`) sends\nit to its negative, while `P₊` is bar-even (`flip_Pp`) — the sign sits in `h`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_asym_zero_of_h","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_asym_zero_of_h","kind":"theorem","line":261,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L261-L264","doc":"At `h = q − q⁻¹ = 0` the skein difference vanishes: no asymmetry at `q = ±1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_asym_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_asym_swap","kind":"theorem","line":253,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L253-L259","doc":"The eigenline swap exchanges the two weightings: the skein difference of the swapped\nletter is the mirror projector `(q − q⁻¹)(q + q⁻¹)·P₋`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_asym_mul_Pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_asym_mul_Pp","kind":"theorem","line":248,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L248-L251","doc":"… and acts on the `q`-line by the scalar `(q − q⁻¹)(q + q⁻¹) = q² − q⁻²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_asym_mul_Pm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_asym_mul_Pm","kind":"theorem","line":243,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L243-L246","doc":"**The skein difference annihilates the `(−q⁻¹)`-line.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_mirror_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_mirror_eq","kind":"theorem","line":236,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L236-L241","doc":"The mirror weighting: `q⁻¹·s − q·s⁻¹ = (q − q⁻¹)(q + q⁻¹)·P₋`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_asym_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.skein_asym_eq","kind":"theorem","line":229,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L229-L234","doc":"`q·s − q⁻¹·s⁻¹ = (q − q⁻¹)(q + q⁻¹)·P₊`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.no_one_sided_letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.no_one_sided_letter","kind":"theorem","line":195,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L195-L220","doc":"**No one-sided flip is a letter.** An element inverting the eigenvalue on `P₊` only\n(acting by `q⁻¹` on `P₊`, unchanged `−q⁻¹` on `P₋`) satisfies a Hecke relation at some\nparameter `p` only if `q² = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_ne_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_ne_swap","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L183-L193","doc":"**The orientation flip is not the eigenline swap.** The flip keeps `P₊` as the\nprojector of its matching eigenvalue; the swap sends it to `P₋`; and `P₊ ≠ P₋`\nwhenever `P₊ ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_Pm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_Pm","kind":"theorem","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L178-L181","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_Pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_Pp","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L173-L176","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_hecke","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L167-L171","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_eq_neg_flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap_eq_neg_flip","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L164-L165","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_eigen_minus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_eigen_minus","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L155-L160","doc":"… and on the `(−q⁻¹)`-line (eigenvalue `−q`). The flip acts on BOTH lines. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_eigen_plus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_eigen_plus","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L148-L153","doc":"The flipped letter inverts the eigenvalue on the `q`-line … ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_Pm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_Pm","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L142-L146","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_Pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_Pp","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L134-L140","doc":"**The orientation flip fixes the `q`-line projector** (read at the flipped\nparameter `q⁻¹`, where the flipped letter's matching eigenvalue is `q⁻¹`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip_hecke","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L128-L132","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.Pp_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.Pp_idem","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L121-L124","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.Pp_mul_Pm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.Pp_mul_Pm","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L115-L119","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.eigen_minus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.eigen_minus","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L106-L113","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.eigen_plus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.eigen_plus","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L97-L104","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.Pp_add_Pm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.Pp_add_Pm","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L90-L95","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.inv_letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.inv_letter","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L84-L88","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.Pm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.Pm","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L79-L80","doc":"Projector onto the eigenvalue-`(−q⁻¹)` line. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.Pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.Pp","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L76-L77","doc":"Projector onto the eigenvalue-`q` line. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.swap","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L73-L74","doc":"The eigenline swap `s ↦ h − s` (`= −s⁻¹` on a letter). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.flip","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L70-L71","doc":"The orientation flip `s ↦ s − h` (`= s⁻¹` on a letter). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.IsLetter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.IsLetter","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/HelicityCommonSource.lean#L67-L68","doc":"The Hecke relation at parameter `q`: `x² = (q − q⁻¹) x + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}